      "html": "<div class=\"ds-empty\"><div class=\"ds-empty-icon\">☕</div><div class=\"ds-empty-title\">Belum ada produk</div><div class=\"ds-empty-desc\">Tambahkan menu cafe kamu agar bisa mulai transaksi di POS.</div><div class=\"ds-empty-hint\">Contoh: Es Kopi Susu — Harga 18.000, HPP 6.000</div><button class=\"ds-btn-accent\">+ Tambah Produk</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-empty{background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E5E3DE;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06);padding:20px;text-align:center} .ds-empty-icon{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:#F2F1ED;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:24px;margin:0 auto 12px} .ds-empty-title{font-weight:800;font-size:14px} .ds-empty-desc{color:#6B6B6B;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;margin-top:6px;max-width:320px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto} .ds-empty-hint{background:#F4E9E0;color:#A66A3F;font-size:12px;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;margin-top:12px} .ds-empty .ds-btn-accent{width:100%;margin-top:14px;min-height:44px}"
